{
    "title": "SmartNews: News That Matters",
    "description": "At SmartNews, we simplify how you read news. Get access to trustworthy articles from your favorite publishers for free. Stay connected to the world around you through vetted content covering everything from politics and health to sports and entertainment.\r\n\r\nRead news from premium publishers: Bloomberg, The Atlantic, USA Today, TIME, The Huffington Post, Bleacher Report, Quartz, The Verge, LAT, VOX, AP, Reuters, Buzzfeed, Fast Company.\r\n\r\nSTART YOUR DAY WITH SMARTTAKE \r\nEscape misinformation and stress with SmartTake, a free daily digest of unique and balanced information. Curated by our award-winning editors, SmartTake offers quality\r\n updates on global, local, entertainment, sports, politics, and health, helping you keep it light and feel good about being informed.\r\n\r\nPolitics\r\n-  Get prepared for the elections, polls, and debates with balanced stories across the political spectrum from Democrat to Republican.\r\n- Understand candidates, ballot measures, debates, results, and city council elections near you.\r\n-Find voter information, campaign finance stories, verified election reports, and expert election analysis you can trust.\r\n\r\nQuality \r\n-We partner with thousands of trusted publishers for balanced news.\r\n-Our award-winning journalists validate content to ensure it meets our high-quality\r\n requirements.\r\n- Read trustworthy breaking coverage for your area for free.\r\n\r\nEntertainment  \r\n-Get an inside look at entertainment.\r\n-Discover top movies or TV shows with your favorite actors. \r\n-Follow entertainment topics so you never miss a story.\r\n\r\nLocal \r\n-Get informative stories from quality publishers based on your location. \r\n-See the latest local government coverage in your hometown \r\n-Discover local updates, traffic, events, local weather, new restaurants, family activities, politics, school boards, and more.\r\n\r\nSports\r\n-Get daily articles highlighting the latest games, teams, players, and sporting events.\r\n-Set notifications for your favorite teams.\r\n-See breaking news about football, basketball, golf, tennis, soccer, and more.\r\n\r\nHealth\r\n-Discover the healthcare news that impacts you all in one free app. \r\n-See what experts say about wellness, aging, and mental health from top publishers.\r\n-Follow stories about pain relief updates, exercise trends, and home remedies. \r\n\r\n***\r\nIN THE PRESS\r\n\r\n\u201cBrowse headlines quickly, customize your channels, and read the news offline. SmartNews is an excellent free alternative to other popular news apps.\u201d\r\n- CNET\r\n\r\n***\r\nAWARDS\r\n\r\nBest Local News App, 2024 (US)\r\nBestapp\r\n\r\nBest News Aggregator, 2023 (US)\r\nLifewire\r\n\r\nBest News App, 2023  (US)\r\nAndroidCentral\r\n\r\n***\r\nREVIEWS\r\n\r\n\u201cBetter than Feedly or Flipboard. Love it!\u201d Joe C.\r\n\r\n\u201cMuch better than the new version of Apple News.\u201d - Donald B.\r\n\r\n\u201cBeen using Google News but this is better. Much easier to share.\u201d Nikki H.\r\n\r\n***\r\nTerms of Service\r\nThe SmartNews Terms of Service are linked below. Please read and confirm these terms before using our services.\r\nhttps://www.smartnews.com/terms/",
    "descriptionHTML": "At SmartNews, we simplify how you read news. Get access to trustworthy articles from your favorite publishers for free. Stay connected to the world around you through vetted content covering everything from politics and health to sports and entertainment.<br><br>Read news from premium publishers: Bloomberg, The Atlantic, USA Today, TIME, The Huffington Post, Bleacher Report, Quartz, The Verge, LAT, VOX, AP, Reuters, Buzzfeed, Fast Company.<br><br>START YOUR DAY WITH SMARTTAKE <br>Escape misinformation and stress with SmartTake, a free daily digest of unique and balanced information. Curated by our award-winning editors, SmartTake offers quality<br> updates on global, local, entertainment, sports, politics, and health, helping you keep it light and feel good about being informed.<br><br>Politics<br>-  Get prepared for the elections, polls, and debates with balanced stories across the political spectrum from Democrat to Republican.<br>- Understand candidates, ballot measures, debates, results, and city council elections near you.<br>-Find voter information, campaign finance stories, verified election reports, and expert election analysis you can trust.<br><br>Quality <br>-We partner with thousands of trusted publishers for balanced news.<br>-Our award-winning journalists validate content to ensure it meets our high-quality<br> requirements.<br>- Read trustworthy breaking coverage for your area for free.<br><br>Entertainment  <br>-Get an inside look at entertainment.<br>-Discover top movies or TV shows with your favorite actors. <br>-Follow entertainment topics so you never miss a story.<br><br>Local <br>-Get informative stories from quality publishers based on your location. <br>-See the latest local government coverage in your hometown <br>-Discover local updates, traffic, events, local weather, new restaurants, family activities, politics, school boards, and more.<br><br>Sports<br>-Get daily articles highlighting the latest games, teams, players, and sporting events.<br>-Set notifications for your favorite teams.<br>-See breaking news about football, basketball, golf, tennis, soccer, and more.<br><br>Health<br>-Discover the healthcare news that impacts you all in one free app. <br>-See what experts say about wellness, aging, and mental health from top publishers.<br>-Follow stories about pain relief updates, exercise trends, and home remedies. <br><br>***<br>IN THE PRESS<br><br>\u201cBrowse headlines quickly, customize your channels, and read the news offline. SmartNews is an excellent free alternative to other popular news apps.\u201d<br>- CNET<br><br>***<br>AWARDS<br><br>Best Local News App, 2024 (US)<br>Bestapp<br><br>Best News Aggregator, 2023 (US)<br>Lifewire<br><br>Best News App, 2023  (US)<br>AndroidCentral<br><br>***<br>REVIEWS<br><br>\u201cBetter than Feedly or Flipboard. Love it!\u201d Joe C.<br><br>\u201cMuch better than the new version of Apple News.\u201d - Donald B.<br><br>\u201cBeen using Google News but this is better. Much easier to share.\u201d Nikki H.<br><br>***<br>Terms of Service<br>The SmartNews Terms of Service are linked below. Please read and confirm these terms before using our services.<br>https://www.smartnews.com/terms/",
